rule: EXPECTED_VALUE_CHANGED
title: pytest.approx(expected=105.0) -> pytest.approx(105.0) states the same expected value: no finding
origin: #462 — approx's expected value was read by position only, so the cleanup read as "independent expected call replaced by literal 105.0" and blocked at high
